% expect-output: true
% Scenario: a form is defined and found. The instance under /Logo in
% the Form category is executed, and its status stays true.
/Logo << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> /Form defineresource pop
/Logo /Form findresource execform
showpage
/Logo /Form resourcestatus 3 1 roll pop pop =
